# Safety Guidelines for AI Agent

## Terminal Command Limits
- Never install packages/dependencies.
- Never remove/delete files.
- Ask before execute any command.

## Code Modification Rules
- Do NOT edit files inside `vendor/` or `node_modules/`.
- Never updates the database.
- Never alter existing migrations that have already run.
- Keep validation logic strict inside Laravel Form Requests, not raw controllers.
- Never modify files unless explicitly authorized.
- Never delete files.
- Never change configuration files without asking first.
- Never modify .env or secrets.
- Never change Git configuration.
- Never perform destructive operations.
- If requirements are ambiguous, ask instead of guessing.
- Make the smallest possible change.
- Don't refactor unrelated code.
- Don't change working code just for style.
- Never modify unrelated files to resolve an error.
First identify the root cause and explain which file needs to change.
